<div class="wb-check-options">
  <p class="wb-dialog-meta">AGL {{modifier}} · 1 reaction</p>
  <label>Against<select name="against"><option value="attack">Direct attack</option><option value="area">Area save</option></select></label>
  <label>Attack total / save DC<input type="number" name="target" step="any" placeholder="Optional"></label>
  <label class="wb-check-toggle" data-tooltip="A direct attack that rolled a natural 20 cannot be Dodged"><input type="checkbox" name="natural20"> Incoming natural 20</label>
  {{#if heavyArmor}}<p class="wb-warning">Heavy armor · disadvantage applies.</p>{{/if}}
  <fieldset class="wb-dice-choices">
    <legend>Dice</legend>
    <label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="normal" {{#unless heavyArmor}}checked{{/unless}}> Normal</label>
    <label data-tooltip="Roll two d20s; keep the higher"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="advantage"> Advantage</label>
    <label data-tooltip="Roll two d20s; keep the lower"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="disadvantage" {{#if heavyArmor}}checked{{/if}}> Disadvantage</label>
  </fieldset>
  <label class="wb-check-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="spendReaction" {{#if spendReaction}}checked{{/if}}> Spend 1 reaction ({{reactions}} left)</label>
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>How Dodge works</summary>
    <p>Roll d20 + AGL for yourself. Beat a direct attack's total to avoid all damage; a tie fails. For an area attack, meet or beat its save DC to halve damage before Resistance and Armor Rating. Leave the target blank to compare manually.</p>
    <p>Natural 20 direct attacks and non-attack area effects, such as mind control, cannot be Dodged. The natural 20 option applies only to direct attacks.</p>
    <p>Use Dodge once per incoming attack. A failed Dodge may be followed by Block or Parry with another reaction. No AP cost; untick spending for practice. Apply Health changes manually. Wonder is available on the resulting chat card.</p>
    {{#if heavyArmor}}<p>Heavy armor without STR 21 gives disadvantage on Dodges. Change the selected dice for other effects or corrections.</p>{{/if}}
  </details>
</div>
